<<if $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<investigateicon>>><<link [[查塞拉母钟事 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Meet]]<<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
