:: MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>>
狼街与北岭林道交界的青石涵洞前，阿什正用猎刀起出两枚生铁防兽夹，林恩却按住他的手腕，指着涵洞口新立的宵禁木栅。阿什沉声说夜雾越界时野狼会顺暗渠扑进孤儿院后巷，撤掉铁夹等于放兽进街；林恩却坚持晚归苦力常在雾里踩中暗夹，巡防铁栅才守得住人命。两人隔着一盏防风马灯僵持不下，目光同时落向刚走近的你。
<<if $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>两人都认得你，只是谁也不肯先把手里那盏马灯放下。<<else>>你和他们还不算熟，只能站在涵洞外先听。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[挪猎夹守兽径 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[钉木栅护住夜行 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[拉响铃绳两全其美 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>>
马灯在涵洞口晃了一下，阿什先开口，猎刀还卡在铁夹里：「铁夹不能撤。」林恩按着木栅回他：「木栅也不能拆。」雾里传来狼嚎。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你替阿什将防兽夹移入涵洞枯草并刻下刀痕，阿什颔首记下人情，林恩却冷脸记入隐患。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你助林恩将白漆木栅钉死涵洞并挂好铜牌，林恩神色稍缓，阿什却收夹退回树影不再多言。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你横拉浸蜡麻绳挂上三枚空心铜铃，野兽撞绳即响而苦力不伤脚，阿什与林恩双双认可。
<<else>>
你系绳时误触铁夹弹簧夹断木桩，阿什皱眉收夹、林恩沉脸封路，你磨破手掌且分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[记下界桩之争 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Ash Lin Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.c