:: MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
深林寒溪边的腐木洼地里，诺艾尔正戴着薄皮手套去夹一丛泛着幽蓝磷光的伞菌，准备带回温室抑制母株排异。阿什一箭钉在她脚前三寸的泥地里，沉声喝止：这丛夜光菌是林间盲眼野猪的诱饵，一旦拔除，发狂的兽群当夜就会冲毁南侧巡林道。诺艾尔护住玻璃标本瓶不肯后退，说母株今晚若断了活性菌丝便再难熬过排异期。
<<if $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔认得你，阿什也认得你，可两人的手都没离开各自的家伙。<<else>>你在寒溪边还算生面孔，只能先站在腐木外侧。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[掩菌窝护兽径 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[支持诺艾尔规矩 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[剪孢子留菌窝两全 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
溪水漫过腐木，诺艾尔先护住标本瓶：「母株等不到明天。」阿什的箭钉在她脚前三寸，夜鸟被惊得乱叫。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你帮阿什用腐叶掩好夜光菌窝并撒上硫磺粉，阿什交付备用弓弦，诺艾尔却抱着空瓶默然疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你替诺艾尔遮挡视线将蓝磷伞菌移入广口瓶，诺艾尔感激记情，阿什却冷眼转身加固兽障。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你只剪取伞盖外缘三缕孢子便将菌根封回腐木，既留住诱兽气味又够接种，双方各自心安。
<<else>>
你掰菌伞时不慎蹭破毒囊令菌粉失活，诺艾尔叹息洗瓶、阿什不满散味，此行你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好寒溪菌样 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Ash Noel Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
