:: MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
北岭哨所的石砌瞭望台上，塞拉正对照银壳怀表将一座黄铜风速仪锁死在石槽正中，要求守林哨钟今后严格按整点敲响。阿什却一把拔起铜底座的定位销，说林子里的寒雾从不看表，风向一变就得立刻移桩改道，死守钟点只会把进山的人送进死谷。塞拉捏着单眼放大镜寸步不让，坚持没有基准时刻就测不出雾潮推进的真正周期。
<<if $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉与阿什都与你打过交道，此刻却各自盯着自己的刻度。<<else>>你和他们只算见过几面，瞭望台上的风比你先开口。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[移风标随山风 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[钉死正北的刻度 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[装黄铜活扣分内外 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
黄铜叶片被风拨得直响，塞拉先按住怀表：「整点就是整点。」阿什拔着定位销、压着红布旗，山雾从石缝涌上来。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你帮阿什把风速仪挪上活石底座随山风偏转，阿什教你辨认暗记，塞拉却合上怀表神色转冷。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你替塞拉扶稳铅垂线将风速仪钉死正北刻度，塞拉浅笑记情，阿什却拔走红布风旗独自离去。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你在石槽内加装黄铜活扣，外圈供塞拉整点抄表、内圈随阿什风旗偏转，两人握手言和。
<<else>>
你拧铜楔时手滑刮花表盘又撞裂木桩，塞拉心疼收表、阿什沉脸送客，你两头落空分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好风标校记 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Ash Sera Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (6), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (6), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs