:: MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
森林暗河汇入旧港的芦苇浅滩边，维斯的夜航快艇正拖着三捆泡水的冷杉原木往外栈桥滑行，船头铁钩却挂断了阿什布在河口的拦雾浮木堰。阿什站在齐膝深的冷水里拽住缆绳，寒声质问谁准许夜船拆毁林道防波桩；维斯按着船舷冷笑，说这批船材天亮前不进坞，整条栈桥的夜班船工都得停工。浪头拍打着倾斜的木桩，两人手按刀柄与船篙，眼看就要动手。
<<if $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯认得你，阿什也认得你，可谁都没把刀和船篙放下。<<else>>你在浅滩上还是生人，只能先踩进齐膝的冷水里。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[跳浅滩压船尾 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[割断藤索放快艇 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[趁退潮拔桩再顶回 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
浪头撞在断堰上，维斯先按着船舷：「天亮前不进坞，整条栈桥都得停。」阿什在齐膝冷水里拽紧缆绳，芦苇被风吹得沙沙响。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你跳下浅滩帮阿什将铁锚钩死船尾逼卸原木，阿什将火种拨旺，维斯却冷眼划低了你的契约。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你挥刀割断藤索撑篙助快艇滑出芦苇湾，维斯抛来铜锚扣记情，阿什却站在断堰旁神色转冷。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你算准退潮间隙拔开侧桩放木排过闸再顶回主桩，浮堰未毁且船材准点，双方双双收刃。
<<else>>
你硬拉湿缆绳滑倒在泥水里任原木撞歪木桩，两人只顾抢修无暇理你，此番你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收拢河湾浮木 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.ash.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
