:: MP NPC Cross Ash Vesper Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossFlags["ash_vesper"] to ($mpCrossChoice or "done")>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.ash to "和维斯的那件事（河湾浮木拦堰）">>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.vesper to "和阿什的那件事（河湾浮木拦堰）">>
芦苇浅滩的水波渐渐平息，浮木堰与夜航道在河口分出界限，河湾的雾还没散尽，浅滩上只剩水声。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>阿什把铁锚钩死船尾，维斯冷眼卸下原木，浮木堰守住了、船期误了。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>维斯撑篙把快艇滑出芦苇湾，阿什守着断堰没有拦，船材准点进了坞。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>趁退潮拔开侧桩放木排过闸，再顶回主桩，浮堰与船材都保住了。
<<else>>湿缆绳一滑，你摔进泥水，原木撞歪木桩，两人各自抢修顾不上你。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转赴对方页 (0:03)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回访首方日程 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[回访次方日程表 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
高街与康努达图斯街交界的死巷口，莫奈趁着宵禁后的浓雾支起折叠画架，正借着煤气路灯描摹暗巷墙根的阴影轮廓。巡夜至此的林恩按住她的画夹，按章要求她在半刻钟内收摊回阁楼，理由是最近贝利的收债马车常在这条巷子截人。莫奈却把沾着群青的画笔横在胸前，说白天的光太假，只有宵禁后的雾影才画得出这座镇子的真骨头。
<<if $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>林恩与莫奈都认识你，只是谁也没先合上手里的簿子和画夹。<<else>>你和他们还不熟，巷口的煤气灯先照出了你的影子。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[折画架劝回楼 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[缠住巡夜争暗部 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[挪画架进背风死角 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
煤气灯咝咝响，林恩先按住画夹：「半刻钟，收摊。」莫奈把群青画笔横在胸前：「白天的光画不出这条巷。」远处传来车轮声。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你帮林恩折起画架将莫奈劝回阁楼楼梯口，林恩添上巡防信赖，莫奈却关门嫌你不懂夜色。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你在巷口缠住林恩替莫奈争出三笔暗部时间，莫奈塞来炭笔小稿，林恩却严肃扣减了信赖。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你将画架挪进岗棚屋檐背风死角借防风灯作画，既不违宵禁又保住雾影，两人各自松气。
<<else>>
你调光时撞翻松节油罐引来街口巡哨，莫奈画纸洇废、林恩立案训诫，你狼狈空手分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好夜灯小稿 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
