:: MP NPC Cross Lin Monet Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossFlags["lin_monet"] to ($mpCrossChoice or "done")>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.lin to "和莫奈的那件事（暗巷夜灯写生）">>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.monet to "和林恩的那件事（暗巷夜灯写生）">>
煤气路灯在湿石板上投下长影，松节油味与岗棚姜汤的热气在夜风里交融。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>林恩折起画架，莫奈抱着画夹退回阁楼，宵禁的界线守住了、雾影稿废了。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>莫奈在巷口多画三笔暗部，林恩退到街对面等，画稿留住了、巡防松了一寸。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>画架挪进岗棚屋檐的背风死角，借防风灯照亮墙角，两人隔灯各退半步。
<<else>>松节油罐翻倒引来巡哨，画纸洇成一团，两人收拾东西上楼，都不想再提。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转赴对方页 (0:03)|MP NPC Cross Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
