:: MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
宅邸街旧暗渠的铁格栅旁，诺艾尔正提着药篮半跪在湿石阶上，试图刮取渠壁砖缝里新生的灰黑霉斑回去配制解毒剂。林恩一把拉上封锁铁链，沉声告知此处正是三年前旧搭档霍克坠亡的暗渠现场，任何人在结案前不得破坏砖壁痕迹。诺艾尔捏着银刮勺焦急万分，说这批霉斑一旦被明早的涨潮水冲走，学园温室里染了寒瘴的病患就得断药。
<<if $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔记得你，林恩也记得你，可铁链与药篮都没松开。<<else>>你在暗渠口还算生面孔，只能先站在铁栅外。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[锁铁链护旧案 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[支持诺艾尔规矩 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[拓旧靴印再取浮菌 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
暗渠水滴砸在石阶上，林恩先拉铁链：「结案前不能动砖壁。」诺艾尔握着银刮勺半跪湿苔：「涨潮一冲，药就断了。」铁栅轻响。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你替林恩锁上暗渠铁链劝离诺艾尔，林恩向你透露旧案水尺疑点，诺艾尔却低头数花瓣疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你借检查铁链遮住视线让诺艾尔刮走霉斑，诺艾尔赠茶道谢，林恩却收回了岗棚备用钥匙。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你先用炭纸拓全砖缝旧靴印再让诺艾尔只取表层浮菌，物证与药引两全，双方同时颔首。
<<else>>
你扶铁栅打滑摔碎药瓶冲毁了霉斑与粉笔线，林恩喝令退开、诺艾尔叹气，你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好暗渠拓片 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[封存旧案的菌样 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Outcome]]>><<pass 10>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -1>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -1>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Ma