:: MP NPC Cross Lin Noel Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossFlags["lin_noel"] to ($mpCrossChoice or "done")>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.lin to "和诺艾尔的那件事（暗渠霉斑取样）">>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.noel to "和林恩的那件事（暗渠霉斑取样）">>
宅邸街暗渠口重新落锁，风里还留着陈醋与潮湿青苔的气味，铁栅上的水珠一滴滴往下落。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>林恩锁上铁链，诺艾尔收起刮勺退开，旧案的砖壁保住了、药引没取成。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>诺艾尔刮走表层霉斑，林恩收回备用钥匙，药引够了、粉笔线断了一截。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>炭纸拓下旧靴印，诺艾尔只取表层浮菌，物证与药引都留住了。
<<else>>铁栅一滑，药瓶摔碎，霉斑与粉笔线一起冲毁，两人都没再看你。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转赴对方页 (0:03)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回访首方日程 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[回访次方日程表 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
高街钟表铺后方的校时台前，林恩正拿着市政厅刚签发的雾夜治安令，要求塞拉将今晚的宵禁报时钟提前一刻钟敲响，以便守夜队封锁暗巷。塞拉隔着玻璃展柜按住基准母钟的摆轮，语气虽轻却寸步不让：钟表铺的报时与全城水尺、航海钟咬合，人为拨快一刻钟会让整座港湾的潮汐表全数失准。两人一个讲街头治安、一个讲分秒节律，谁也不肯先退半步。
<<if $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉与林恩都与你相熟，却一个按着摆轮，一个压着治安令。<<else>>你和他们只打过几次照面，钟楼里的滴答声先替他们说话。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[出示警戒簿子 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[守钟台回绝改钟 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[鸣钟再吹双哨清街 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
三十六座钟各走各的，塞拉先按住摆轮：「一刻钟，全港水尺都会偏。」林恩把治安令拍在柜上，纸角带露，街外传来短棍敲墙声。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你出示街头警戒簿助林恩逼钟表铺提前鸣钟，林恩赞你顾全大局，塞拉却摘下放大镜疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你替塞拉守住修表台回绝改钟要求，塞拉推来热红茶记情，林恩却皱眉合上治安令转冷。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你让塞拉按基准整点鸣钟并陪林恩提前吹响双音铜哨预警收摊，母钟与街防得以两全。
<<else>>
你拨副钟分针时不慎卡死三问报时簧引乱街面，塞拉抢修机芯、林恩弹压，你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好校刻记录 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Lin Sera Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (6), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (6), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (6), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to