<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossFlags["lin_sera"] to ($mpCrossChoice or "done")>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.lin to "和塞拉的那件事（钟楼宵禁校刻）">>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.sera to "和林恩的那件事（钟楼宵禁校刻）">>
高街钟楼的整点钟声与巡夜哨音先后在雾里回荡，母钟与街防对上了同一拍，钟摆还在数着停顿。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>林恩拿治安令逼钟表铺提前鸣钟，塞拉摘下放大镜退开，街防就位、母钟偏了半刻。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>塞拉守住修表台，林恩合令出门，母钟分秒未动、巡防晚了一刻。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>塞拉按基准鸣钟，你陪林恩提前吹响双音铜哨清街，两边各守一半。
<<else>>副钟分针卡死，报时簧乱成一片，两人抢修弹压，都怪你多手。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转赴对方页 (0:03)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回访首方日程 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[回访次方日程表 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
旧港与梅尔街交界的水道暗闸前，维斯的夜航驳船刚靠上湿滑石阶，准备把几名没有通行铜牌的夜班船工送上岸歇脚。守在闸口的林恩横过短棍拦住跳板，要求按宵禁条例逐一登记船工姓名与住处，以防贝利或走私团伙趁雾混入内街。维斯按着船舷冷声回应：夜航船的规矩向来是只记舱单不报真名，一旦名单落进官册，这群苦力明早就会被债主堵门。
<<if $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯与林恩都识得你，可跳板与短棍谁也没收。<<else>>你在暗闸边还是生人，只能先听潮水与铁链的动静。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[提灯核验船工 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[弄响木桶放船工 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[立双锚保条记代号 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, watch: 20, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 15 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
暗闸铁链在潮水里哗啦一响，林恩先横短棍：「登记，一个都不能少。」维斯按着跳板：「名单进官册，明早债主就堵门。」炉火一明一暗。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你提灯帮林恩守住暗闸逐一核验上岸船工，林恩邀你并肩夜巡，维斯却退回灰雾削减契约。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你在巷口弄响木桶引开视线放船工入暗渠，维斯留下一份暗港人情，林恩却沉下脸扣减信赖。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你促成维斯出具双锚保条只记泊位代号并由林恩监管去向，苦力底细与宵禁铁律两不误。
<<else>>
你两边遮掩导致口供矛盾惊动港务哨兵，维斯断缆退船、林恩按章驱散，你白跑且分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好夜闸保条 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Lin Vesper Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.watch or 20) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus or 20) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.axis to $mpNpcs.lin.watch>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.lin.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
