:: MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcMonet>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
学园标本室里间的玻璃温室旁，莫奈正盯着培养皿里一簇罕见的孔雀绿共生菌丝，提出要用三份松节油将其研磨成壁画高光急需的翠青色。诺艾尔立刻张开双臂挡在皿柜前，急切地解释这簇铜绿菌丝是母株排异期唯一的活体指示剂，一旦混入松节油就会全部坏死。莫奈却晃着调色刀说全城矿物颜料都压不出这种活色，两人围着恒温皿柜争执不休。
<<if $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>莫奈与诺艾尔都认识你，却一个攥着刮刀，一个护着皿柜。<<else>>你在温室里还算生客，只能先站在恒温柜外。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[挑走半皿菌丝 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[支持诺艾尔规矩 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[磨脱壳菌衣调翠色 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcMonet>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
恒温柜风扇低低转着，莫奈先晃调色刀：「全城矿物颜料都压不出这种活色。」诺艾尔挡在皿柜前，菌丝在灯下泛孔雀绿。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你趁诺艾尔关窗帮莫奈挑走半皿孔雀绿菌丝，莫奈调出绝色记情，诺艾尔却眼眶微红疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你替诺艾尔锁上恒温皿柜回绝取菌入画，诺艾尔调安神茶谢你，莫奈却收起刮刀冷淡下楼。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你剥下皿边自然脱落的干枯菌壳兑入蓝铜矿粉研磨，活菌无损且翠色透亮，两人相视而笑。
<<else>>
你不慎将松节油滴入培养皿令菌丝与底粉俱毁，诺艾尔开窗抢救、莫奈弃稿，你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好孔雀绿稿 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Monet Noel Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.monet.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
