:: MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcNoel>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
学园标本室与钟表铺交接的恒温烘箱前，塞拉取下刚拆开的黄铜温控发条盒，神情凝重地指出齿轮表面已被酸性孢子水汽蚀出了绿斑。诺艾尔捧着记录册小声分辩：母株夜里排异剧烈，她必须把湿度调到八成以上才能保住气生根，并非有意损坏塞拉借给温室的精密温控钟。塞拉捏着镊子说再这样受潮三天，整套恒温摆轮就会彻底停摆，两人一时都没了主意。
<<if $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>诺艾尔与塞拉都记得你，却一个捧着记录册，一个捏着镊子。<<else>>你和她们还不算熟，烘箱的滴答声先填满了屋子。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[搭湿布保母株 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拆温控钟去保养 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[涂蜂蜡云母隔酸气 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcNoel>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
烘箱滴答乱了拍，塞拉捏起发条盒：「齿轮已被蚀出绿斑。」诺艾尔捧着册子：「湿度降到八成以下，母株保不住。」空气里全是孢子味。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你帮诺艾尔把湿布搭回透气孔先保母株雾气，诺艾尔感激记情，塞拉却看着受潮游丝轻叹。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你帮塞拉拆下受潮温控钟收入雪松盒保养，塞拉欣慰记情，诺艾尔却只能彻夜手喷水而疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你用纯蜂蜡混钟表油涂满接缝并在感温片外覆薄云母隔酸，湿气不蚀齿轮且恒温钟照走。
<<else>>
你误涂带酸性的草药脂令摆轮粘连停摆，塞拉连夜拆洗、诺艾尔抢救苗床，你忙活却分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好恒温铜匣 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Noel Sera Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (4), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.axis or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust t