:: MP NPC Cross Noel Vesper Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcNoel>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossFlags["noel_vesper"] to ($mpCrossChoice or "done")>>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.noel to "和维斯的那件事（底舱受潮异种）">>
<<set $mpNpcCrossLast.vesper to "和诺艾尔的那件事（底舱受潮异种）">>
栈桥边的焦油火盆渐渐熄灭，海风吹散最后一缕苦涩烟气，潮水还在拍着石阶。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>诺艾尔撬箱取出三枚发芽球茎，维斯独自应付暗哨，母本救回、风险留给船长。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>维斯把整箱球茎倾进火盆，诺艾尔看着黑灰退开，检疫干净了、母本成灰。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>剖开腐壳只取无菌芽芯封进银盒，外箱推入火炉，检疫无据、母本得保。
<<else>>木箱一翻，球茎滚下石阶撞上巡哨，两人忙着周旋捡拾，只剩一炉冷灰。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Noel Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转赴对方页 (0:03)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回访首方日程 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[回访次方日程表 (0:04)|MP NPC Vesper Schedule]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Meet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
防波堤天文钟塔内，维斯按着配重盘要求塞拉将今夜港务母钟调慢三分钟，好让暗港船队趁换班无声入港。塞拉护住擒纵叉坚定拒绝：母钟是全港校对暗礁潮位的基准，慢一秒外海渔船都可能触礁；维斯却沉声说不借这三分钟，船上欠债学徒就会落进贝利手里。
<<if $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>塞拉与维斯都与你相熟，可配重盘与船篙谁也没放下。<<else>>你和他们只打过几回交道，塔里的钟摆先替他们数着。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Sera Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转返对方页 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[锁配重守母钟 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "a">><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[挂铅副配重迟鸣 (0:10)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "b">><</link>><br>
<<link [[偏转百叶造出暗带 (0:12)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Clash]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 0) gte 20 and ($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) gte 20>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_ok">><<else>><<set $mpCrossChoice to "c_fail">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Clash [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, rep: 50, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>><<mpInitNpcVesper>>
母钟走得很稳，维斯按住配重盘：「慢三分钟，船队能无声进港。」塞拉护住擒纵叉：「慢一秒，渔船就可能触礁。」浪声紧过一阵。
<<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">>
你帮塞拉锁死配重箱坚持防波堤母钟分秒不改，塞拉感念共守底线，维斯却因船舷擦伤转冷。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">>
你替维斯挂上铅制副配重让母钟迟鸣三分钟护船入港，维斯抛扣记情，塞拉却看着秒针疏远。
<<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">>
你让塞拉准点鸣钟护渔船并替维斯将副塔遮光百叶偏转三度造出暗影带，母钟与夜船两全。
<<else>>
你手动按停遮光百叶被铜杆震麻手腕导致灯光大亮惊动哨船，两人忙于补救，你分文未得。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回现场 (0:02)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Meet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收好母钟校记 (0:08)|MP NPC Cross Sera Vesper Outcome]]>><<pass 8>><<if $mpCrossChoice is "a">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "b">><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (7), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (-2), 0, 100)>><<stress -2>><<elseif $mpCrossChoice is "c_ok">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (5), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (2), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.love to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.love or 0) + (1), 0, 100)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.cadence to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.cadence or 25) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.axis to $mpNpcs.sera.cadence>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.sera.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.axis to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.axis or 0) + (-3), 0, 100)>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper.trust to Math.clamp(($mpNpcs.vesper.trust or 0) + (-1), 0, 100)>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>
